Package: lintwright
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: static analysis for Debian source packages
 lintwright checks a Debian source tree for the policy details that break
 archive uploads and slow down review: malformed changelog trailers, missing
 source formats, obsolete debhelper compat levels, install paths under
 /usr/local, and maintainer scripts without set -e.
 .
 It runs offline, has no third-party dependencies, and emits both
 human-readable and JSON output so it can gate a CI pipeline.
